1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,172
7:02 a.m. Your phone buzzes.

2
00:00:03,462 --> 00:00:08,737
Plus $1. Sender: unknown.
Memo... your name.

3
00:00:09,027 --> 00:00:11,620
MOM: Nev! Breakfast!

4
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:13,366
Ding. Another dollar.

5
00:00:13,656 --> 00:00:14,699
MR. HALL: Nev?

6
00:00:14,849 --> 00:00:18,099
KIDS: Nev! Nev! Nev! Nev!

7
00:00:18,249 --> 00:00:22,466
So what if you earned $1...
every time someone said your name?

8
00:00:23,656 --> 00:00:25,399
Okay. First, you test it.

9
00:00:25,689 --> 00:00:30,191
NEV: Nev. Nev... Nev!

10
00:00:30,341 --> 00:00:33,608
Nothing. Your own voice doesn't count.

11
00:00:33,898 --> 00:00:39,099
Texting it doesn't count either. It has
to be said out loud. By someone else.

12
00:00:39,389 --> 00:00:43,113
So you call the one person who
will do anything for free food.

13
00:00:43,403 --> 00:00:46,623
JAKE: Wait. You'll buy me
tacos if I just say your name?

14
00:00:46,623 --> 00:00:51,641
Nev. Nev. Nev! Nev, Nev, Nev!

15
00:00:51,791 --> 00:00:52,647
Six dollars.

16
00:00:52,937 --> 00:00:58,103
JAKE: Bro, this is the easiest job I've
ever had! Nev! Nev-Nev-Nev! Hahaha!

17
00:00:58,253 --> 00:01:01,109
By lunch, Jake has said
your name 240 times.

18
00:01:01,109 --> 00:01:04,574
You buy him three tacos.
You're still up 230 bucks.

19
00:01:05,564 --> 00:01:07,795
After school, you test a few loopholes.

20
00:01:08,085 --> 00:01:12,574
Loophole #1: Jake's parrot,
Captain. He knows exactly one word.

21
00:01:12,864 --> 00:01:16,999
JAKE: Come on, Captain. Say it.
Say it! Who's a good boy?

22
00:01:17,149 --> 00:01:20,441
CAPTAIN: Nev! Nev! Nev! Nev!

23
00:01:20,591 --> 00:01:24,440
+1. +1. +1. Birds count!

24
00:01:24,730 --> 00:01:29,027
By dinner, Captain has made
you $87... and he wants a cut.

25
00:01:29,317 --> 00:01:34,635
JAKE: Premium crackers, bro.
He says it's in his contract. Hahaha!

26
00:01:35,285 --> 00:01:38,743
Loophole #2: you scream your own
name in the empty school gym.

27
00:01:39,033 --> 00:01:45,157
NEV: Neeeev!

28
00:01:45,307 --> 00:01:48,771
The echo screams it back.
Nev... Nev... Nev...

29
00:01:49,061 --> 00:01:53,299
Zero dollars. An echo is just your
own voice... bouncing off a wall.

30
00:01:54,089 --> 00:01:58,307
Loophole #3: that night, you sleep-talk
your own name for six straight hours.

31
00:01:58,597 --> 00:02:03,131
Six hours. Zero dollars.
Your own voice still doesn't count.

32
00:02:04,021 --> 00:02:05,846
Then you learn the fine print.

33
00:02:06,136 --> 00:02:09,722
Whispers count.
Even a whisper is a full dollar.

34
00:02:10,012 --> 00:02:17,490
JAKE: Nevvy? Nevster?
Nev-a-licious? Hahaha!

35
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:22,153
Nicknames don't count.
Only the real thing. N, E, V.

36
00:02:22,443 --> 00:02:23,928
And recordings don't count.

37
00:02:23,928 --> 00:02:28,184
A video of someone saying your name,
played a million times, pays you zero.

38
00:02:28,474 --> 00:02:31,003
But a million people...
saying it themselves?

39
00:02:32,193 --> 00:02:34,681
Day three. You figure out the real trick.

40
00:02:34,971 --> 00:02:36,572
Names spread.

41
00:02:36,862 --> 00:02:41,069
You sign up for the school talent show.
Your act? You just... stand there.

42
00:02:41,359 --> 00:02:43,308
And the whole gym chants.

43
00:02:43,598 --> 00:02:46,848
KIDS: Nev! Nev! Nev! Nev!

44
00:02:46,998 --> 00:02:52,376
400 kids. 90 seconds. Plus... $11,000.

45
00:02:52,666 --> 00:02:55,004
Somebody films it.
By Friday, it's a trend.

46
00:02:55,294 --> 00:02:58,998
#SayNev. 14 million views.

47
00:02:59,288 --> 00:03:03,284
Kids in Ohio. A grandma in Texas.
A guy on a fishing boat in Alaska.

48
00:03:03,574 --> 00:03:04,917
Everybody is saying your name.

49
00:03:05,207 --> 00:03:07,359
And your phone... never stops buzzing.

50
00:03:07,649 --> 00:03:11,938
Day nine. $1,284,000.

51
00:03:12,228 --> 00:03:15,562
You buy your mom a new car.
You buy Jake a lifetime supply of tacos.

52
00:03:15,852 --> 00:03:18,073
JAKE: I'm not crying.
You're crying! Hahaha.

53
00:03:18,823 --> 00:03:20,337
Then you start spending.

54
00:03:20,627 --> 00:03:24,108
You pay off the house.
Mom cries in the kitchen for 20 minutes.

55
00:03:24,398 --> 00:03:28,702
You buy a gaming PC so big it
needs its own fan... for its fan.

56
00:03:28,992 --> 00:03:33,737
You tip a waitress $1,000.
She says, thank you, Nev. Plus one.

57
00:03:34,027 --> 00:03:35,577
JAKE: Bro, we should start a business.

58
00:03:35,577 --> 00:03:38,222
I'll be the manager. You'll be...

59
00:03:38,222 --> 00:03:39,299
the name.

60
00:03:39,449 --> 00:03:41,229
Jake prints T-shirts that just say NEV.

61
00:03:41,229 --> 00:03:45,989
He sells 9,000 of them.
Everybody who reads one out loud...

62
00:03:45,989 --> 00:03:47,439
pays you.

63
00:03:48,929 --> 00:03:53,328
Then, Monday morning...
Jake doesn't laugh.

64
00:03:53,618 --> 00:04:02,354
JAKE: Bro... my bank account. It's empty.
Like, zero. I had 240 dollars yesterday.

65
00:04:02,504 --> 00:04:04,713
Two hundred and $40.

66
00:04:05,003 --> 00:04:07,629
The exact number of
times he said your name.

67
00:04:07,919 --> 00:04:11,754
You check the transfers.
Every single one has a sender.

68
00:04:11,754 --> 00:04:13,720
They're not coming from nowhere.

69
00:04:14,010 --> 00:04:19,026
Every time someone says your name...
the dollar comes out of their pocket.

70
00:04:19,316 --> 00:04:24,304
MOM: Honey, my card got declined at
the grocery store. That's weird, right?

71
00:04:24,454 --> 00:04:28,460
She said your name eleven times
this week. Calling you for dinner.

72
00:04:28,750 --> 00:04:35,020
14 million people said Nev.
14 million people are $1 poorer.

73
00:04:35,020 --> 00:04:37,499
And they're starting to notice.

74
00:04:38,389 --> 00:04:40,972
A bus driver in Ohio
can't fill up his tank.

75
00:04:41,262 --> 00:04:44,597
A grandma in Texas finds $40
missing from her pension.

76
00:04:44,597 --> 00:04:47,796
She said your name 40 times.
She thought it was cute.

77
00:04:48,086 --> 00:04:50,176
People stop saying it. They point.

78
00:04:50,176 --> 00:04:53,520
They write it on paper.
They call you, that kid.

79
00:04:53,810 --> 00:04:57,325
JAKE: Bro, my mom grounded me
for saying your name at dinner.

80
00:04:57,325 --> 00:04:59,029
She thinks I'm in a gang.

81
00:04:59,179 --> 00:05:04,609
NEWS ANCHOR: Breaking news. Thousands of
Americans report a mysterious $1 charge...

82
00:05:04,609 --> 00:05:07,241
every time they say one name.

83
00:05:08,091 --> 00:05:11,567
By Wednesday...
nobody says your name anymore.

84
00:05:11,857 --> 00:05:15,145
MR. HALL: Student 14. Present?

85
00:05:15,295 --> 00:05:19,056
JAKE: Hey... dude. Hey, you. Uh... buddy.

86
00:05:19,206 --> 00:05:21,082
Your best friend won't say your name.

87
00:05:21,372 --> 00:05:28,201
Your mom calls you sweetheart now.
Kiddo. Champ. Anything but Nev.

88
00:05:28,491 --> 00:05:29,666
The counter stops.

89
00:05:29,956 --> 00:05:34,663
And for the first time in your life... you
realize how good it felt to just hear it.

90
00:05:35,753 --> 00:05:36,963
You try to make it stop.

91
00:05:37,253 --> 00:05:41,063
You change your name. Online forms,
a judge, the whole thing.

92
00:05:41,063 --> 00:05:43,019
Your new name is Steve.

93
00:05:43,309 --> 00:05:46,139
Nothing changes.
People still know you as Nev.

94
00:05:46,139 --> 00:05:48,499
And the money follows
the name people say...

95
00:05:48,499 --> 00:05:50,142
not the name on the paper.

96
00:05:50,432 --> 00:05:53,567
JAKE: Steve? Bro,
you don't look like a Steve.

97
00:05:53,567 --> 00:05:56,725
You look like... yeah, I'm not saying it.

98
00:05:57,975 --> 00:06:03,705
So you open the bank app.
14,200,000 transfers.

99
00:06:03,995 --> 00:06:06,667
There's a button you
never noticed. Return all.

100
00:06:06,957 --> 00:06:08,257
Your thumb shakes.

101
00:06:08,547 --> 00:06:10,294
It's every dollar you have.

102
00:06:10,584 --> 00:06:11,388
You press it.

103
00:06:11,678 --> 00:06:18,212
Across America, 14 million phones
buzz at once. Plus $1. Memo: sorry.

104
00:06:18,502 --> 00:06:19,219
MOM: Nev?

105
00:06:19,369 --> 00:06:21,391
It's the first time in a
week anyone has said it.

106
00:06:21,681 --> 00:06:25,459
Your phone doesn't buzz.
Plus nothing. Minus nothing.

107
00:06:25,749 --> 00:06:27,133
It's just your name again.

108
00:06:27,423 --> 00:06:30,338
MOM: Nev! Dinner! Love you, kiddo.

109
00:06:30,488 --> 00:06:36,351
JAKE: Nev! Nev! Nev! Bro, it's free now!
I'm gonna say it all day! Hahaha!

110
00:06:37,701 --> 00:06:42,003
That night, at 3:33 a.m.,
your phone lights up one last time.

111
00:06:42,293 --> 00:06:47,156
Plus $1. Sender: unknown. Memo... Jake.

112
00:06:47,446 --> 00:06:50,019
JAKE: Wait. Why did I just get a dollar?

113
00:06:50,969 --> 00:06:54,142
Whose name would YOU want to get
paid for? Tell us in the comments.
